#. module: account_statement_reconcile_improvements
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:account_statement_reconcile_improvements.field_account_bank_statement__import_file_hash
msgid "Import File Hash"
msgstr "Hash del archivo importado"

#. module: account_statement_reconcile_improvements
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_statement_reconcile_improvements.field_account_bank_statement__import_file_hash
msgid ""
"SHA-256 of the source file used to import this statement, used to block re-"
"importing the exact same file for the same journal. Empty for statements not"
" created by a file import."
msgstr ""
"SHA-256 del archivo de origen usado para importar este extracto, usado para "
"bloquear la reimportación del mismo archivo para el mismo diario. Vacío para"
" extractos no creados por importación de archivo."

#. module: account_statement_reconcile_improvements
#: model:ir.model.constraint,message:account_statement_reconcile_improvements.constraint_account_bank_statement__import_file_hash_uniq
msgid "This bank statement file was already imported for this journal."
msgstr "Este archivo de extracto bancario ya fue importado para este diario."

#. module: account_statement_reconcile_improvements
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_statement_reconcile_improvements/models/account_bank_statement.py:0
msgid ""
"This file was already imported for this journal as statement %(name)s, on "
"%(date)s by %(user)s. Import blocked to avoid duplicating transactions."
msgstr ""
"Este archivo ya fue importado para este diario como el extracto %(name)s, el"
" %(date)s por %(user)s. Se bloqueó la importación para evitar duplicar "
"movimientos."

#. module: account_statement_reconcile_improvements
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:account_statement_reconcile_improvements.field_account_journal__bank_statement_import_profile
msgid "Bank Statement Import Profile"
msgstr "Perfil de importación de extracto bancario"

#. module: account_statement_reconcile_improvements
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_statement_reconcile_improvements.field_account_journal__bank_statement_import_profile
msgid ""
"Technical field: last successful import settings (column mapping and file "
"format options) for this journal, used to prefill the bank statement import "
"wizard next time."
msgstr ""
"Campo técnico: configuración de la última importación exitosa (mapeo de "
"columnas y opciones de formato del archivo) para este diario, usada para "
"precargar el asistente de importación de extractos la próxima vez."

#. module: account_statement_reconcile_improvements
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:account_statement_reconcile_improvements.field_res_company__bank_statement_auto_reconcile_to_check
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:account_statement_reconcile_improvements.field_res_config_settings__bank_statement_auto_reconcile_to_check
msgid "Flag auto-reconciled statement lines to check"
msgstr "Marcar a revisar las líneas de extracto conciliadas automáticamente"

#. module: account_statement_reconcile_improvements
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_statement_reconcile_improvements.field_res_company__bank_statement_auto_reconcile_to_check
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_statement_reconcile_improvements.field_res_config_settings__bank_statement_auto_reconcile_to_check
msgid ""
"When a bank statement line is reconciled automatically (by a reconciliation "
"model, by the CUIT-based partner match on import, or by the auto-reconcile "
"button) with no contact backing the match, keep it flagged as \"to check\" "
"instead of marking it fully reviewed. Lines with a confirmed contact are "
"always treated as reviewed."
msgstr ""
"Cuando una línea de extracto bancario se concilia automáticamente (por un "
"modelo de conciliación, por el match de contacto vía CUIT al importar, o por"
" el botón de conciliación automática) sin un contacto que respalde la "
"coincidencia, mantenerla marcada \"a revisar\" en lugar de darla por "
"revisada. Las líneas con un contacto confirmado siempre se consideran "
"revisadas."

#. module: account_statement_reconcile_improvements
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_statement_reconcile_improvements.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid "Auto-reconciled bank statement lines"
msgstr "Líneas de extracto conciliadas automáticamente"

#. module: account_statement_reconcile_improvements
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_statement_reconcile_improvements.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"Statement lines reconciled automatically on import or by a reconciliation "
"model"
msgstr ""
"Líneas de extracto conciliadas automáticamente al importar o por un modelo "
"de conciliación"

#. module: account_statement_reconcile_improvements
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_statement_reconcile_improvements.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid "Flag them as to check instead of fully reviewed"
msgstr "Marcarlas a revisar en lugar de darlas por revisadas"

