#. module: account_statement_reconcile_improvements
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_statement_reconcile_improvements.view_account_bank_statement_unlink_wizard_form
msgid ""
"Deleting these statements will unreconcile and delete all of their statement"
" lines, including reconciled ones, reopening the matched invoices/payments "
"as pending. This cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"Eliminar estos extractos desconciliará y eliminará todas sus líneas, "
"incluidas las conciliadas, volviendo a dejar pendientes las facturas/pagos "
"asociados. Esta acción no se puede deshacer."

